      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "It seems that this is entirely about the JavaScript interface. Does it affect the HTTP API as well? Or even OCFL?",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "From my experience Unicode characters in filenames will most certainly appear when running a repository. European and especially Eastern countries will run into this issue very quickly. While I’m not a fan of storing files under their submitted names it became clear in the past that the originally submitted name must at least be preserved.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
