   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "In the administrative interface, if I try to add a binary with a filename like \"fileõnameõ.md\" I get an error in my console and the resource is not created:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Uncaught TypeError: XMLHttpRequest.setRequestHeader: Cannot convert argument 2 to ByteString because the character at index 27 has value 55357 which is greater than 255.\r\n    http http://localhost:8080/static/js/common.js:24\r\n    http http://localhost:8080/static/js/common.js:24\r\n    fn http://localhost:8080/static/js/common.js:55\r\n    onload http://localhost:8080/static/js/common.js:80\r\n    addChild http://localhost:8080/static/js/common.js:79\r\n    <anonymous> http://localhost:8080/static/js/common.js:499\r\n    listen http://localhost:8080/static/js/common.js:39\r\n    <anonymous> http://localhost:8080/static/js/common.js:490\r\n    ready http://localhost:8080/static/js/common.js:32\r\n    <anonymous> http://localhost:8080/static/js/common.js:483\r\n    <anonymous> http://localhost:8080/static/js/common.js:520\r\ncommon.js:24:41\r\n    http http://localhost:8080/static/js/common.js:24\r\n    forEach self-hosted:206\r\n    http http://localhost:8080/static/js/common.js:24\r\n    fn http://localhost:8080/static/js/common.js:55\r\n    onload http://localhost:8080/static/js/common.js:80\r\n    (Async: EventHandlerNonNull)\r\n    addChild http://localhost:8080/static/js/common.js:79\r\n    <anonymous> http://localhost:8080/static/js/common.js:499\r\n    (Async: EventListener.handleEvent)\r\n    listen http://localhost:8080/static/js/common.js:39\r\n    <anonymous> http://localhost:8080/static/js/common.js:490\r\n    (Async: EventListener.handleEvent)\r\n    ready http://localhost:8080/static/js/common.js:32\r\n    <anonymous> http://localhost:8080/static/js/common.js:483\r\n    <anonymous> http://localhost:8080/static/js/common.js:520",
